  message: "2026-09-29 (WI-mufag, PR #1299): measured a sibling of this glob gap -- growthbook's findings stayed 43 structural after the binding-named walk shipped, because its code is mostly .tsx and the typescript DDG spec globs *.ts only. .tsx belongs in the same decision as .mjs/.cjs/.jsx."  # 08d5
