- op: discuss  # 3f41
  at: '2026-10-03T06:42:06Z'  # 3f41
  by: agent  # 3f41
  actor: jgstern_agent  # 3f41
  clock: 4  # 3f41
  nonce: 3f41  # 3f41
  message: "PREMISE AUDIT 2026-10-03 (owner-requested; read-only, reproduced at dev 3abedae588 on small fixtures). CURRENT, with additions. Title widened.\n- ts_def_use.py:375 file_glob=\"*.js\" and :361 file_glob=\"*.ts\"; ddg_build.py:568 walks repo_root.rglob(spec.file_glob), a single string (introduced in f93d16b42a, WI-nonad). Repro: one function in 8 files, one per extension; build_repo_ddg(languages=('javascript','typescript')) produces DDG edges only from .js and .ts.\n- STEP 1 ANSWERED: survey classifies .mjs/.cjs/.jsx as javascript and .tsx/.mts/.cts as typescript, and all produce function symbols. Only the DDG specs lag.\n- STEP 2 OPEN: cfg_nodes/typescript.yaml has no jsx entries.\n- NEW: the grammar comes from get_language(spec.language) (ddg_build.py:546), and the typescript grammar does not parse JSX. So .tsx cannot be fixed by widening the TS glob: it needs a per-glob grammar override or a second spec, keeping language=\"typescript\" so symbol ids match.\n- SCOPE: .mts/.cts are also omitted (never named in the item). Related, not duplicates: WI-hizon (linkers' narrow globs), WI-pokij (language_from_path grammar-name labels)."  # 3f41
